    <string name="noise_sample_note">Faqat shovqin eshitiladigan qismni belgilang — odatda yozuvning boshi, hali gapirilmagan payt. Dastur shu qismdan shovqin darajasini o\'lchab, keyin uni butun fayldan ayiradi.</string>
